## Key Concepts
- needs: test — deploy job waits for test job to pass
- if: github.ref — only deploy from main branch, not feature branches
- GitHub Secrets — store RENDER_DEPLOY_HOOK securely
- secrets.RENDER_DEPLOY_HOOK — access secret inside workflow
- curl — command line HTTP request to trigger Render deployment
- Two-job workflow — separation of concerns, test then deploy

## Why This Matters
- Code only reaches production if tests pass
- No manual deployment steps needed
- Every commit is automatically verified and deployed
- Industry standard CI/CD workflow
- Shows DevOps knowledge to employers
